    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Liberec like never before \u2014 through someone else\u2019s eyes, in real locations, with choices that truly matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Interaktivn\u011b o Liberci&quot;</strong> is a short interactive first-person film, fully shot on a professional cinema camera. You play as a local welcoming a long-lost visitor to Liberec \u2014 and every decision you make shapes how the day unfolds. Where you go, who you meet, and how it all ends\u2026 it\u2019s all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you\u2019ll be the perfect guide. Other times, things might go completely sideways. And be warned \u2014 some choices might cut the story short entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 What to expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 Authentic first-person interactive film, shot on a cinema-grade camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded Every choice reshapes the story \u2014 new places, different people, unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude04 Dry humor, unexpected turns, and natural, human dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 2\u201315 minutes of gameplay, depending on your path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64 Single-player experience with optional group play at offline events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9 Real locations across Liberec \u2014 from iconic spots to hidden corners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who wants to explore a city differently \u2014 with a sense of humor, curiosity, and the understanding that even the smallest decision can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your visit to Liberec starts now.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience Liberec like never before \u2014 through someone else\u2019s eyes, in real locations, with choices that truly matter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Interaktivn\u011b o Liberci&quot;</strong> is a short interactive first-person film, fully shot on a professional cinema camera. You play as a local welcoming a long-lost visitor to Liberec \u2014 and every decision you make shapes how the day unfolds. Where you go, who you meet, and how it all ends\u2026 it\u2019s all up to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sometimes you\u2019ll be the perfect guide. Other times, things might go completely sideways. And be warned \u2014 some choices might cut the story short entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 What to expect:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 Authentic first-person interactive film, shot on a cinema-grade camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udded Every choice reshapes the story \u2014 new places, different people, unique endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude04 Dry humor, unexpected turns, and natural, human dialogue</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd52 2\u201315 minutes of gameplay, depending on your path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc64 Single-player experience with optional group play at offline events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9 Real locations across Liberec \u2014 from iconic spots to hidden corners</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for anyone who wants to explore a city differently \u2014 with a sense of humor, curiosity, and the understanding that even the smallest decision can change everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your visit to Liberec starts now.</p>",
